From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:09:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(questions): generate addition, subtraction,
 multiplication, and division problems

- One generator per operation, each following DIFFICULTY_RULES:
  addition caps the sum where a level limits it, subtraction never goes
  below zero, multiplication shows factors in either order, and
  division builds the dividend from the divisor and a whole quotient
- generateProblem validates each attempt, retries up to 10 times, then
  logs in development and returns a known-good fallback problem
- generateProblemForOperations picks one of the selected operations at
  random for mixed practice
- Add seeded tests covering every operation and level, range edges,
  divide-by-zero prevention, fallback, and operation mixing
